WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.100
Who's involved?

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.212
Developers maintain the
collector and the realm guard.

3
00:00:04.212 --> 00:00:07.001
The OCI platform lead owns this gate.

4
00:00:07.001 --> 00:00:12.000
The owners of systems on OCI, an HR platform
among them where the agency has one,

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.438
receive the maintenance
that names their resources.

6
00:00:15.438 --> 00:00:19.213
And the security officer keeps
the policy and the run folder.

7
00:00:19.213 --> 00:00:24.150
What the reader may hold is one policy
statement: read announcements in the tenancy.

8
00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:28.675
Inspect is enough to list, but read
is what the details call needs.

9
00:00:28.675 --> 00:00:32.848
Grant only inspect and you get
summaries without affected resources,

10
00:00:32.848 --> 00:00:35.500
so nothing routes as
naming your resources.
